@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #375A7F
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF1F8
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EAF1F8
skinparam activityBorderColor #375A7F
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3D6
title Hybrid pipelines: POST /analyze
actor Client
control "Analyze controller" as API
control "Application service" as Service
participant "Ollama /api/generate" as LLM
control "Structured RDF converter / RDFLib" as RDF
Client -> API: POST /analyze (text, max_rdf_attempts?, options?)
API -> API: Validate fields and trim text
API -> Service: AnalyzeRequest
Service -> Service: Load prompt files; start correlated event log
participant "Wikidata MCP client" as MCP
Service -> LLM: Extract mentions from input text
LLM --> Service: Entity extraction JSON
Service -> Service: Strict parsing, realignment, supplementation and deduplication
loop Each mention and its candidate group
  Service -> MCP: search_items, then get_statements for every candidate
  MCP --> Service: Candidate entities and statements
end
Service -> MCP: Build bounded cross-mention paths (at most two hops)
MCP --> Service: Paths with high-degree intermediates excluded
loop Up to three disambiguation attempts, pending groups only
  Service -> LLM: Text, candidate groups and path context; selection JSON schema
  LLM --> Service: Supplied QID selections
  Service -> Service: Validate selections; accumulate valid groups
end
note over Service
  No automatic candidate selection.
  Unresolved or invalid selections after retries: HTTP 422.
end note
Service -> MCP: Retain direct relationships among selected entities
MCP --> Service: Grounded relationship evidence
Service -> Service: Build RDF prompt from text and selected evidence

loop Up to max_rdf_attempts (clamped to 1-3), stop on success
  Service -> LLM: Generate RDF triples with JSON schema
  note right of LLM
    JSON schema constrains the RDF response.
    CSV records the raw model output.
  end note
  LLM --> Service: Structured triples JSON
  Service -> RDF: Validate fields, identifiers and literal metadata
  RDF -> RDF: Normalize kg names; create RDF terms and Graph
  RDF -> RDF: Serialize Turtle; parse and check graph postconditions
  alt Valid graph
    Service -> RDF: Apply Wikidata-ID and label postconditions; revalidate
    RDF --> Service: Validated Turtle string
    Service --> API: AnalyzeResponse
    API --> Client: HTTP 200 (text, entities, relationships, rdf, source_attribution, llm, ned)
  else Invalid response and attempts remain
    RDF --> Service: Validation error
    Service -> Service: Add previous output and error to retry prompt/history
  else Attempts exhausted
    RDF --> Service: Validation error
    Service --> API: RDFValidationError
    API --> Client: HTTP 422 (error, attempts, details)
  end
end
note over Service, RDF
  Bundled clients request JSON; custom clients may supply valid legacy Turtle.
  RDF regeneration reuses existing grounding evidence.
  Request events record validation outcomes when logging is configured.
end note
@enduml
